# Cursor Rules for Kalis

Always read and strictly adhere to `AGENTS.md`.

## Core Guidelines
- Platform: Kalis (Israeli University Admissions & Sekem Optimization)
- Tech Stack: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Lucide React
- All 8 Israeli universities must be supported: Technion, TAU, HUJI, BGU, Haifa, Ariel, Bar-Ilan, Reichman
- UI Text: High-level Hebrew with `dir="rtl"`
- Pure Calculators: Never import DB or UI into `src/modules/calculators/`
- Verification: Always ensure `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build` succeed before finishing.
